{
  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's perception-action cycle, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and allowed actions. The specification automata E1-E4 bind each perception outcome to exactly one safe, efficient action, enforcing deterministic recovery and exploration policies. This ensures systematic coverage, obstacle avoidance, and no oscillation or unsafe action is possible.",
